#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:6
msgid "macOS Environment Setup"
msgstr "macOS 环境搭建"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:8
msgid ""
"This document details the complete steps to set up the UniSDK development"
" environment on macOS."
msgstr ""
"本文档详细介绍了在 macOS 上搭建 UniSDK 开发环境的完整步骤。"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:10
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:12
msgid "macOS 12 (Monterey) or higher"
msgstr "macOS 12 (Monterey) 或更高版本"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:13
msgid "Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3) or Intel processor"
msgstr "Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3) 或 Intel 处理器"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:14
msgid "At least 4 GB RAM"
msgstr "至少 4 GB RAM"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:16
msgid "Install System Dependencies"
msgstr "安装系统依赖"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:18
msgid "We recommend using the [Homebrew](https://brew.sh) package manager:"
msgstr "我们推荐使用 [Homebrew](https://brew.sh) 包管理器："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:28
msgid "Verify installation:"
msgstr "验证安装："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:37
msgid "Set Up Python Virtual Environment"
msgstr "搭建 Python 虚拟环境"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:54
msgid "Initialize West"
msgstr "初始化 West"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:61
msgid "Configure Toolchain"
msgstr "配置工具链"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:63
msgid ""
"Since UniSDK uses the RISC-V cross-compilation toolchain, you need to "
"obtain the corresponding macOS version of the toolchain from Telink."
msgstr ""
"由于 UniSDK 使用 RISC-V 交叉编译工具链，您需要从 Telink 获取对应 macOS 版本的工具链。"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:65
msgid "Contact Telink to obtain the macOS toolchain"
msgstr "联系 Telink 获取 macOS 工具链"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:66
msgid "Extract to a designated directory:"
msgstr "解压到指定目录："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:71
msgid "Set the environment variable:"
msgstr "设置环境变量："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:75
msgid ""
"It is recommended to add the above command to `~/.zshrc` (the default "
"shell on macOS)."
msgstr ""
"建议将上述命令添加到 `~/.zshrc`（macOS 的默认 shell）。"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_macos.md:77
msgid "Verify Environment"
msgstr "验证环境"

